diagram developIssuesUntilApproved "developIssuesUntilApproved: full agent flow"
viewport 180x52
theme midnight
direction right

node input "INPUT\n\nissues: [65, 66, …]\nmaxIterations = M (default 5)" at 1,12 size 19x8 kind input
node phase_issues "phase: issues" at 3,21 size 16x3 kind phase

group issues "parallel(\"issues\")" at 23,3 size 70x38 kind parallel

group issue65 "issue-65" at 24,5 size 66x11 kind lane in issues
group approval65 "developUntilApproved" at 43,6 size 45x9 kind group in issue65
group repeat65 "iteration 1…M" at 44,8 size 42x7 kind repeat in approval65 dashed
node wt65 "withWorktree(\"issue-65\")\nisolated branch + path" at 25,8 size 18x6 kind shell in issue65
node dev65 "Developer agent\nimplement task /\naddress findings" at 45,9 size 15x4 kind agent in repeat65
node rev65 "Reviewer agent\n(pass, findings)" at 61,9 size 13x4 kind reviewer in repeat65
decision pass65 "pass?" at 75,9 size 8x4 in repeat65
node fail65 "failed review" at 71,13 size 14x2 kind failure in repeat65
text note65 "NEW Developer + NEW Reviewer every iteration" at 44,15 kind dim

